          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono, Yesu ali Omusaayi Omukhulu Lukali okhuyeetanga efwe. Ali omutakatifu, se ali ne kamabi namwe bubwoni bwosi bwosi tawe. Aukhasiibwe khukhwama mu be bubwoni ne khuniinisibwa angaaki we likulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.9.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bal. 9.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Se ali nga basaayi bakhulu babaandi abo tawe; se enyekhana khuaana chimbosio buli ndaalo khulwe bubwoni bwewe nio arusie chichiindi khulwe bubwoni bwe babaandu babaandi tawe. Aana embosio ndala lulala lwong'ene, nga eerusia omwene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lilaka lia Musa liroboraanga babaandu busa khuba basaayi bakhulu; ne kakhali lisuubisia lia Wele liakholwa ne liliechuba, liliecha enyuma we Lilaka, lirobora Omwana owakholwa khuba omwichufu buli lwosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.28"
            ]
          }
        }
